## PromotionsApi

### Create promotions
## Create promotions
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/promotions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Delete promotion by id
## Delete promotion by id
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/promotions/{{promotion_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get promotion by id
## Get promotion by id
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/promotions/{{promotion_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get promotions
## Get promotions
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/promotions?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}
Accept: application/json

### Update promotions
## Update promotions
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/promotions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}

